  unitName: Kyuubi Ginryou
  unitId: 51113
  unitNumber: 1542
  description: The Mystical Fox on the world of Ohbanahara. Legends and fairytales
    tell that it came to exist long before humanity as a divine beast and protector
    of the land. It holds the power to see into the hearts of humans, and has granted
    many blessings on good-natured individuals in the past. However, tales also hold
    that it levies fearsome punishments against those with impure hearts. As a mirror
    for human hearts, it has long been a source of fear and awe for many people.
  summonDesc: Changing your appearance will never deceive me. That is the way of
    the world.
  fusionDesc: I am the looking glass.<br>If you ask of me, I must answer...
  evoDesc: A good effort.<br>So long as you follow the path of the righteous, I will
    aid you on your way.
  element: 5
  rarity: 3
